    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d630">

                <pb facs="1048" n="952" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg952"/>

                <head>No. 628.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation in Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 19, 1873</date>.
                        (Received December 11.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 846.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward herewith a copy
                    and translation of a note, dated yesterday and received to-day, from Mr.
                    Carvajal, in reply to my answer to his note of the 14th, rejecting the protest
                    made against the inhumanities practiced at Santiago de Cuba.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer><signed>D. E. SICKLES.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d630-a1.xml" xpointer="d630-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
